{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:hsvg:2.0:schema:capability:lines",
  "title": "HyperSVG 2.0 capability lines: Spoken lines",
  "description": "spoken lines under addons.lines.lines of a scene, shell, component or compound (6.11, D31): timed text that may be voiced, with word times and word events; a line moves the cues of the block's mouth (the mouth field is core: a loudness mouth of synth uses its target too) | the call lines.say with {line} starts a line of the block (one at a time: a running line ends first); the call lines.stop ends it; lines:ended:<line> fires when a line ends, with {interrupted} | a story link that hears lines:ended:<line> of its from scene waits for that line; a line never started fires the link after its declared length from the scene's entry (3.4) | the ambient spoken value moves while a line runs; without lines it stays {line: \"\", text: \"\", word: -1} and a mouth's cues stay still | captions of a running line, in the shell's captions slot or a default box",
  "$comment": "Generated by docs/spec-2.0-work/tools/schema/make-schemas.mjs from the spec/2.0 machine files. Do not edit.",
